[ceiling] These are the two complete octagonal boss-crown seats in the top clamp. They face the bed 19 mm above the print plane and are intentionally supported: the production profile gives each its own bed-rooted tree with 18.4 mm of build-up before the interface. Their Y=41.025 centres follow the reference pump's offset rear-stack axis.
